  "notes": "Specifically refers to audio recording, as distinct from video recording. The kanji literally combine {録|ろく} (record) and {音|おん} (sound).\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {録音|ろくおん}{機能|きのう}: recording function\n- {録音|ろくおん}データ: recording data\n- {録音|ろくおん}スタジオ: recording studio\n- {録音|ろくおん}{禁止|きんし}: recording prohibited\n- ボイス{録音|ろくおん}: voice recording\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {録画|ろくが}する: to record video — captures both image and sound, while {録音|ろくおん} is audio only\n- {収録|しゅうろく}する: to record (for broadcast) — typically used for professional recording of TV/radio programs, while {録音|ろくおん} is more general\n- {撮影|さつえい}する: to film, to photograph — captures visual images, possibly with sound",
  "schema_version": "2.0",
